! PHICL [MW/m#3]: H-i collisional thermal equilibration
!     (Pereverzev 04-MAR-97)
! dT_i/dt=\nu_{ij}(T_j-T_i)
! here \nu_{ij}=744*Z_i^2*Z_j^2*\sqrt{mu_i*\mu_j}*n_j
!   /(\mu_i*T_j+\mu_j*T_i)^(3/2)   [1/s]
! Assumptions:
!    1) 17 is used for Coulomb logarithm
!    2) n_i -> NI;    Z_i -> ZMain;    T_i -> TI;    \mu_i = AMain;
!  j(minority) -> protons;      Z_j = 1;      \mu_j = 1;
!  T_j -> F1;  n_j = NHYDR
! Usage:
!  Let:  T_d=TI  T_p=F1
!  PHICL=2.4E-3*n_H*(dT_H/dt)
!  PI = ... + PHICL
!  SF1= ... - 466.7*PHICL/NHYDR
!
PHICL=1.78*ZMAIN(J)*ZMAIN(J)*sqrt(AMAIN(j))*NI(J)*NHYDR(J)    *(F1(J)-TI(J))/(AMAIN(J)*F1(J)+TI(J))**1.5
